# and draws the Plains and Swamp on top of its library. Two Moxen pay {1}{R}; the Ornithopter is the one sacrificed, not a Mox.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Demand Answers
Island
Island
Island
Plains
Swamp
Island x10

